    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk... i dont think there is a \"new\" me to find. it feels like that person just died when the relationship ended. like the version of me that actually lived and felt things is just gone. i'm just going through the motions of a body that doesn't belong to anyone anymore. it feels kind of pointless to even try to \"reconnect\" when there's nothing left to connect to.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
